WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.777
This query sequences admissions within each patient
LAG retrieves

00:00:05.803 --> 00:00:11.878
the previous discharge time The outer query
subtracts that previous discharge

00:00:11.891 --> 00:00:17.757
from the current admit time The result is the
interval between encounters

00:00:19.495 --> 00:00:24.060
The first admission for each patient has no previous
discharge so it is excluded in

00:00:24.087 --> 00:00:25.100
the final stage
